{"id":"628604a6e030fd6c","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-largecard2-compact-cardinal.md","title":"ZFC Largecard2 Compact Cardinal","display":"df-zfc-largecard2-compact-cardinal — ZFC Largecard2 Compact Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-largecard2-compact-cardinal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-largecard2-compact-cardinal","58-df-zfc-largecard3-compact-cardinal"],"display":"df-zfc-largecard2-compact-cardinal — ZFC Largecard2 Compact Cardinal","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-injective]]","[[58-df-equinumerous]]","[[58-df-infinitary-satisfaction-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-largecard2-compact-cardinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-largecard2-compact-cardinal</span><span>58-df-zfc-largecard3-compact-cardinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-largecard2-compact-cardinal — ZFC Largecard2 Compact Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8317eefb4572709e\" href=\"?note=8317eefb4572709e\" title=\"58-df-injective\">58-df-injective</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"58-df-equinumerous\">58-df-equinumerous</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1d39b089ae4eb942\" href=\"?note=1d39b089ae4eb942\" title=\"58-df-infinitary-satisfaction-data.md\">58-df-infinitary-satisfaction-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\kappa,\\tau,T,T_0\\in V\">\\(A,\\kappa,\\tau,T,T_0\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injective}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Injective}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmallCardinality}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{SmallCardinality}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (set-theoretic predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 使用 <code>58-df-infinitary-satisfaction-data</code> 的词汇集合编码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{InfinitarySentence}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\operatorname{InfinitarySentence}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LkkModel}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\operatorname{LkkModel}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InfinitaryVocabulary}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{InfinitaryVocabulary}_S\\)</span> 使用其中的良基公式树、自由变量及满意递归；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\tau|\">\\(|\\tau|\\)</span> 是词汇中符号的数目。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LkkTheory}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{LkkTheory}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LkkSatisfiable}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{LkkSatisfiable}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2CompactCardinal}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2CompactCardinal}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard3CompactCardinal}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard3CompactCardinal}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> are retained as metasyntactic shorthands</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard2\\text{-}small\\text{-}cardinality}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SmallCardinality}_S(A,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\n\\land\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(A,\\lambda)\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard2\\text{-}small\\text{-}cardinality}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SmallCardinality}_S(A,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\n\\land\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(A,\\lambda)\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard2\\text{-}lkk\\text{-}theory}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{LkkTheory}_S(T,\\kappa,\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{InfinitaryVocabulary}_S(\\tau)\n\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in T\\;\\operatorname{InfinitarySentence}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\varphi,\\kappa,\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard2\\text{-}lkk\\text{-}theory}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{LkkTheory}_S(T,\\kappa,\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{InfinitaryVocabulary}_S(\\tau)\n\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in T\\;\\operatorname{InfinitarySentence}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\varphi,\\kappa,\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard2\\text{-}lkk\\text{-}satisfiable}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{LkkSatisfiable}_S(T,\\kappa,\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{LkkTheory}_S(T,\\kappa,\\tau)\n\\land\\exists\\mathcal M\\in V\\;\n\\operatorname{LkkModel}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal M,T,\\kappa,\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard2\\text{-}lkk\\text{-}satisfiable}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{LkkSatisfiable}_S(T,\\kappa,\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{LkkTheory}_S(T,\\kappa,\\tau)\n\\land\\exists\\mathcal M\\in V\\;\n\\operatorname{LkkModel}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal M,T,\\kappa,\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard2\\text{-}compact\\text{-}cardinal}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2CompactCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\tau,T\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{LkkTheory}_S(T,\\kappa,\\tau)\n\\land\\exists e\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Injective}(e,\\tau,\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall T_0\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nT_0\\subseteq T\n\\land\\mathrm{SmallCardinality}_S(T_0,\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{11em}\\to\\mathrm{LkkSatisfiable}_S(T_0,\\kappa,\\tau)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\mathrm{LkkSatisfiable}_S(T,\\kappa,\\tau)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard2\\text{-}compact\\text{-}cardinal}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2CompactCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\tau,T\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{LkkTheory}_S(T,\\kappa,\\tau)\n\\land\\exists e\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Injective}(e,\\tau,\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall T_0\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nT_0\\subseteq T\n\\land\\mathrm{SmallCardinality}_S(T_0,\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{11em}\\to\\mathrm{LkkSatisfiable}_S(T_0,\\kappa,\\tau)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\mathrm{LkkSatisfiable}_S(T,\\kappa,\\tau)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard2\\text{-}compact\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{ZfcLargecard3CompactCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2CompactCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard2\\text{-}compact\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{ZfcLargecard3CompactCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2CompactCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原有词汇大小至多 κ、所有小于 κ 的子理论可满足则全理论可满足的方案及两个 compact-cardinal 名字保持不变。语法、语义与自由变量界已经在内部依赖中定义；不把本方案无条件替换为别的大基数定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-injective","status":"resolved","id":"8317eefb4572709e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-injective]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-equinumerous",